Package: usbimager-x11
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.41), libx11-6
Conflicts: usbimager, usbimager-gtk
Provides: usbimager
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://bztsrc.gitlab.io/usbimager/
X-Build-Inputs-SHA256: @BUILD_INPUTS_SHA256@
X-Publisher-Stream: @PUBLISHER_STREAM@
Description: Write compressed disk images and create backups (X11)
 Minimal X11 interface with embedded Unifont for writing USB images and
 creating backups. Device access requires appropriate permissions.
